        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "今日は、実際のステージを使用してのリハーサル日。\n僕の心配をよそに、タンタルさんもルププさんも\n真面目に完璧に、リハーサルをこなしてくれた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b1908a4bf7608395684a70b43aa9c98ff70b43e47fb0913096b13fdad5a2c705",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 1,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "お疲れ様でした！\nリハーサルにしておくにはもったいないぐらい\nすごくいいライブでしたよ！",
      "jp_sha256": "b7bce6bbd259156ff21a7d04296ccb54cbe99ccecb04a17a46f611a33e739368",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "수고하셨어요!\n리허설로만 끝내기에는 아까울 만큼\n정말 좋은 라이브였어요!",
      "message_index_0based": 1,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 9,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b006-20261106-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "bad6e5d4c1c23d5e838517bdf3a12840b74ecb818889c0458a5a065daedb8906:000002_567915931063634110:g0:r8",
      "row_index_0based": 8,
      "serialized_row_index": 8,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "お疲れ様でした！\nリハーサルにしておくにはもったいないぐらい\nすごくいいライブでしたよ！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "b0cbf0f6d1d7365dc6b6ded18b1cce9f6133d2ff91642eb6f2520a412042c7f7",
